OL,5,G1600 Composer of the Week: The Venetian
OL,6,G     School
OL,7,     F1/5. Donald Macleod explores the
OL,8,     Fcircumstances that allowed the
OL,9,     Fexplosion of music making in
OL,10,     FVenice, led by Adrien Willaert and
OL,11,     Fthe composers of the Venetian
OL,12,     FSchool.
OL,13,G1700 In Tune
OL,14,     FKatie Derham welcomes countertenor
OL,15,     FIestyn Davies and harpist Oliver
OL,16,     FWass to 80A for a live
OL,17,     Fperformance. Darcey Bussell is in
OL,18,     Fstudio to discuss the Royal Ballet
OL,19,     FSchool at 100.
